  "description": "<p><strong>Green Plantain Chips (500g)</strong></p>\r\n<p>Experience the ultimate snack with DCHICOM's Green Flavour Plantain Chips, a 500-gram delight that's perfect for every occasion. These plantain chips are incredibly crunchy and lightly salted to perfection, providing a satisfying and irresistible taste with every bite.</p>\r\n<p>Crafted from the finest green plantains, our chips offer a deliciously fresh and natural flavour, making them a healthier alternative to traditional potato chips. Not only are they a tasty treat, but they also come with numerous benefits:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Nutrient-Rich: Packed with essential vitamins and minerals like potassium, vitamin A, and vitamin C, these chips support overall health and well-being.</li>\r\n<li>High Fibre Content: Helps in promoting digestive health and maintaining a feeling of fullness, which can aid in weight management.</li>\r\n<li>Gluten-Free: Ideal for those with gluten sensitivities or those following a gluten-free diet.</li>\r\n<li>No Artificial Additives: Made with natural ingredients, ensuring you get the pure, authentic taste of plantains without any unwanted chemicals.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Indulge in the wholesome goodness of DCHICOM's Green Flavour Plantain Chips. Whether you're snacking at home, sharing with friends, or packing a lunch, these chips are the perfect crunchy companion. Treat yourself to a healthier snack choice that doesn't compromise on flavour.</p>",
